WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.320
Join tasks, runs, reviews
and outcomes to measure complete work.

00:00:04.520 --> 00:00:07.040
A task record defines
scope and complexity.

00:00:07.220 --> 00:00:12.600
Run records identify configuration,
tools, cost and elapsed time.

00:00:12.675 --> 00:00:16.240
Reviews capture acceptance,
correction and human effort.

00:00:16.460 --> 00:00:21.200
Outcomes connect those artifacts to rework
and quality over a defined period.

00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:24.720
Compare matched cohorts
and include preparation,

00:00:24.782 --> 00:00:27.360
verification and unsuccessful attempts.

00:00:27.552 --> 00:00:32.080
Time saved requires a separate mechanism
before it becomes realized value.
